openclatura structure-to-name reference data
============================================

tests/fixtures/s2n/openclatura_tests.tsv and the openclatura_name column of
tests/fixtures/s2n/bakeoff_corpus.tsv are derived from openclatura 0.4.3
(lamalab-org, https://github.com/lamalab-org/openclatura), commit
90dc5bcb4910c196122ec0405d06a32929a8f308:

- SMILES strings and expected names mined from its tests/ directory;
- names produced by openclatura 0.4.3 for those SMILES and for the bake-off
  corpus, used as the port-parity reference.

